MODULE: QueueBoundedBulkIgnoresTotalDepth
TARGET: QueueBounded
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: an arrival is judged by its own class check only, so Bulk queues past the current Interactive bound

--- FIND
    /\ \/ observed[r].depth - observed[r].excl >= observed[r].bound
       \/ observed[r].depth >= observed[r].cap
--- REPLACE
    /\ observed[r].depth - observed[r].excl >= observed[r].bound
--- END